Visual palette and the shared GUI/TUI rendering approach follow Molten-Zharr/Almavorn:
https://github.com/Molten-Zharr/Almavorn
The fixed-cell font clipping approach in src/raster.rs is adapted from its gui_fonts.rs.
The theme palettes, typography choices and settings interaction model are adapted
from its preferences.rs, app/settings.rs, ui/settings.rs and ui/dialogs/bindings.rs.

